# assistant — local build/runtime output that must never be committed.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: the repository .gitignore has unanchored rules
# ("build/bin", "frontend/dist"), which for THIS directory would also ignore
# assistant/build/ (the Wails icon/manifest sources) — and wails build refuses to
# run without them. Negating them here keeps the tracked icon set while still
# keeping binaries, installed packages and the built frontend bundle out of git.
#
# Note: this file is loaded IN ADDITION to the repository .gitignore, and a
# negation here cannot resurrect a path the parent file excluded unless the
# directory itself was not excluded; assistant/build/ is not excluded at the top
# level ("build/bin" only matches that exact relative path), so the negations work.

node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
build/bin/
frontend/dist/

!build/
!build/windows/
!build/windows/**
!build/appicon.png
